[statement]
A package whose condition holds and whose dependency cannot be met is
passed over where it also depends on the package completing its
condition: `c`, triggered by `d`, needs `w>1`, which nothing provides,
and `d`, and `d` is installed alone. Without the dependency on `d`, apk
refuses (`install-if/an-unmet-dependency-refuses-the-request`).

[repository]
P:d
V:2

P:c
V:2
D:w>1 d
i:d

[request]
d

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install d 2
